  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x78F1" flags="0x0">
    <title>Intake CVTC Target Correction - High-Detonation State</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xAB5A; 4 rows x 4 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Conditional intake-cam target correction. When ffff2466.bit6 is set, FUN 000bda64 calculates clamp_u8(output_0000b43a - output_0000ab5a + 128); when the bit is clear, it bypasses this map. The corrected target is written to ffff1c5c and enters the intake CVTC target path. Code proves the conditional intake-cam correction path and centered raw arithmetic. The target-vehicle capture contains zero samples with ffff2466.bit6 set, so this branch has no dynamic validation. The high-detonation meaning of the selector, the Cylinder Filling axis name, and the 0.5 degree-per-byte conversion remain catalog candidates. Result disposition: consumer. Static diagnostic context: ENG SPEED [code, homologous_vq35hr, via axis evidence: indexed_by].</description>
