    <title>Base Fuel Schedule K-Value</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0x9284; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Base Fuel Schedule K-Value. The primary calculation in FUN 0003b75c multiplies nonnegative MAF aggregate ffff1e38 by this uint16 scalar before fixed-point normalization produces ffff1e40 and, downstream, Base Fuel Schedule DID 0x1208. Exact code establishes the address, uint16 representation, stock value 26806, MAF-to-BFS position, and multiplicative role. UpRev names this calibration K - Fuel Multiplier and states MAF * K = BFS; A2L independently names it K-Value and supplies ms/kg. The engineering unit remains source-derived pending hardware validation. A2L MAF Factor is a separate airflow scalar and is not an alias for this word. Static diagnostic context: CID=1208H_B/FUEL SCHDL [code, nissan_family_candidate, via map evidence: writes].</description>
