  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1E69" flags="0x0">
    <title>Knock Threshold by Evaluator Channel</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0x1108E; 6 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Knock Slice Map: per-evaluator-channel knock threshold by engine speed. A calculated metric exceeding the interpolated threshold contributes to increasing the knock count. 00049ffc selects one of six one-based evaluator rows, interpolates 16 uint16 points along axis 0x15340, and stores the threshold for comparison in 0004a238. Stock rows 3 and 5 are all 0xffff. Value 0xffff is the uint16 upper bound and makes exceeding the threshold practically impossible. The catalog identifies the rows as cylinders, but exact code does not establish their physical cylinder or sensor order.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="12" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>Engine Speed [RPM]</units>
      <indexcount>16</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
