    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0x175C8; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Trustful QH0/torque conversion surface. Forward lookups convert RPM and a QH0 coordinate into offset-binary requested torque; FUN 00073628 interpolates a complete row at current RPM and reverses the relation to recover the QH0 coordinate from centered request ffff19c6. Forward consumers subtract 0x8000 from the uint16 result before signed arithmetic. The stock contents and both axes are byte-identical to primary family 0000e98e/00011d0c/00014114, matching the A2L requirement that primary and trustful maps remain identical. The physical units and multiplier require hardware validation. Result disposition: consumer and inverse coordinate source.</description>
