  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xD31D" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 2 - Fuel Compensation - Main</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xD3100; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Fuel Compensation Map: the unsigned output is a multiplicative fuel correction with raw 128 = 100% as neutral. The result participates in calculating fuel-delivery duration and undergoes uint16 saturation. Common-definition Map 2 storage is projected from 0xA29A. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The machine trace establishes the multiplicative role, while A2L and homolog EV18A 0xa2f6 establish the physical name and scale with the shared layout offset of +0x5c. This is neither a lambda target nor an AFR reciprocal.</description>
