  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x83A9" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 3 - Timing-State Addend - Default/Post-Transition</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xD4088; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Default/post-transition eight-point timing-state addend in FUN 0004afdc. It is selected whenever the stock-inert feature path and warm transition path are not selected and the separate state-3/bit-7 constant bypass is not active. The interpolated result enters ffff1511 through the exact x-128 transform. Common-definition Map 3 storage is projected from 0x12196. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The separate constant path selects raw 0x9e, or +30 counts, when ffff22ff=3 and ffff2458.bit7=1. Target-vehicle A/B evidence isolates 00012196 during matched warm deceleration: a 16-count slot difference at 4000..4400 RPM produced the same 16-count median final-coordinate shift with no corresponding fuel-word shift. This proves one-for-one software-coordinate propagation and makes the catalog Cold Idle qualifier nonexclusive. A crank-referenced degree scale remains unverified. Index: implicit 1D-8 over ffff11b2 with nodes 0,32,...224 and saturation at element 7. Result disposition: writes (RAM ffff1511, site 0004b0d0).</description>
