    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xD2420; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Coolant-indexed rising-edge DFCO entry RPM threshold in FUN 0004fbe2. The stock path selects it when current upstream mode ffff2458.bit5 is set and previous snapshot ffff245a.bit5 is clear; coarse vehicle speed ffff110e must be at least ROM8[000085fa]=4. Common-definition Map 4 storage is projected from 0x12718. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The comparison is strict RPM/25 &gt; threshold. Exact JK00A code interpolates both cut tables on every evaluation and selects this one for the rising mode edge. Target-vehicle A/B evidence in patches/hardware-results.toml shows that retaining this stock entry threshold does not force DFCO entry when the restore classifier returns a nonzero class. Result disposition: inline_comparison. Static diagnostic context: Engine Coolant Temperature [code, homologous_community, via map evidence: indexed_by].</description>
