  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xFF1A" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 5 - Knock-State Path Enable - High-Detonation State</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xD2C00; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. High-detonation hot timing-state surface. It supplies active sample ffff160f only when ffff2466.bit6 is set; the reference remains high-octane surface 0x9A1A. Coordinator 000493e8 also looks it up independently for the conditional signed Q8 difference from 0x9A1A. Common-definition Map 5 storage is projected from 0x9B1A. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. This view edits mask 0x80 and preserves the other bits in each cell. Knock evaluation 0004a238 and coordinator 000493e8 form the state loop that updates the selector for a later pass. A code-proven correction path exists through ffff22fa; code does not prove this surface as a direct final angle. The physical name and scale match homolog EV18A 0x9b76.</description>
