  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xC2B2" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 5 - Engine Speed Limit - Fuel Cut</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xD3518; 2 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Engine-speed fuel-cut hysteresis table consumed directly by FUN 0004f282. Bit 4 of ffff2468 selects column 0 or 1; row 0 is the inclusive activation threshold and row 1 is the exclusive release boundary. Stock delay zero makes activation immediate. Active state bit 2 of ffff2497 reaches periodic index-27 coordinator 0004ed88 and contributes full global mask 0x3f. Common-definition Map 5 storage is projected from 0x934E. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The active stock 2x2 cells decode to 7650/7450 RPM in column 0 and 7450/4600 RPM in column 1. Activation occurs at RPM &gt;= threshold; equality to the release value retains cut and release requires RPM below it. ROM8[00008b38]=0x63 keeps alternate words 00009356/00009358 outside the stock path. The public HR A2L catalog supplies the candidate Normal/Reverse column labels.</description>
