    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xD3F70; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Minimum adaptive Rolling Launch fuel-cut restore hysteresis At activation, the proportional hysteresis is clamped to this inclusive lower endpoint. The runtime then computes Restore = Cut - effective_hysteresis.</description>
