  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x4D37" flags="0x0">
    <title>Rolling Launch RPM Hysteresis Ratio (%)</title>
    <description>Exact JK00A. Address 0xD3F7B; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Captured-RPM ratio (%) used for adaptive Rolling Launch hysteresis The runtime rounds captured_rpm * ratio / 100 to native RPM units once at activation, then clamps the result between the configured minimum and maximum hysteresis.</description>
